erformance of TinyBERT.', 'A benchmark task used for evaluating the performance of TinyBERT.'], 'source_chunk_index': [10, 11, 12, 12, 16]}, 'Ablation Studies': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['Studies conducted to assess the impact of different components or configurations of the TinyBERT model, such as varying model size (number of layers, hidden size) on performance, particularly on GLUE tasks.'], 'source_chunk_index': [10]}, 'CoLA': {'type': ['task', 'dataset', 'dataset', 'GENERIC', 'dataset', 'task'], 'description': ["A downstream task used for evaluating TinyBERT's performance.", 'A task used for evaluating the performance of TinyBERT.', 'A dataset used for evaluating natural language understanding models, specifically in the context of the bottom-strategy performance of TinyBERT.', 'A task used for task-specific distillation.', 'A dataset used for task-specific distillation.', 'A benchmark task used for evaluating the performance of TinyBERT.'], 'source_chunk_index': [11, 12, 12, 14, 14, 16]}, 'No Trm': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A baseline TinyBERT learning configuration that excludes Transformer-layer distillation.'], 'source_chunk_index': [11]}, 'No Emb': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A baseline TinyBERT learning configuration that excludes embedding-layer distillation.'], 'source_chunk_index': [11]}, 'No Pred': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A baseline TinyBERT learning configuration that excludes prediction-layer distillation.'], 'source_chunk_index': [11]}, 'Two-stage TinyBERT learning framework': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A core method of TinyBERT, consisting of General Distillation (GD) during pre-training and Task-specific Distillation (TD) during fine-tuning, often with Data Augmentation (DA).'], 'source_chunk_index': [11]}, 'Two-stage framework': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The learning framework used for TinyBERT, involving General Distillation (GD) during pre-training and Task-specific Distillation (TD) during fine-tuning.'], 'source_chunk_index': [12]}, 'Model Size Reduction': {'type': ['GENERIC'], 'description': ['The process of decreasing the number of parameters in a model, a key goal of TinyBERT.'], 'source_chunk_index': [13]}, 'Inference Time': {'type': ['GENERIC'], 'description': ['The time taken for a model to generate predictions, which TinyBERT aims to reduce.'], 'source_chunk_index': [13]}, 'Edge Devices': {'type': ['GENERIC'], 'description': ["Devices with limited computational resources, where TinyBERT's efficiency makes it suitable for deployment."], 'source_chunk_index': [13]}, 'Pruning': {'type': ['method', 'method'], 'description': ['A method for model compression that removes less important connections or weights in a neural network, resulting in a sparser and more efficient model.', 'A method to remove less important connections in the model, leading to model compression.'], 'source_chunk_index': [13, 13]}, 'BERT LARGE': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A larger version of the BERT model, potentially used as a teacher model for TinyBERT.'], 'source_chunk_index': [13]}, 'XLNet LARGE': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A larger version of the XLNet model, potentially used as a teacher model for TinyBERT.'], 'source_chunk_index': [13]}, 'English Wikipedia': {'type': ['GENERIC', 'dataset'], 'description': ['The text corpus used for pre-training in general distillation.', 'The text corpus used for general distillation, containing 2,500 million words.'], 'source_chunk_index': [14, 14]}, 'QQP': {'type': ['GENERIC', 'dataset'], 'description': ['A task used for task-specific distillation.', 'A dataset used for task-specific distillation, specifically for tasks with greater than or equal to 100K training examples.'], 'source_chunk_index': [14, 14]}, 'QNLI': {'type': ['GENERIC', 'dataset'], 'description': ['A task used for task-specific distillation.', 'A dataset used for task-specific distillation, specifically for tasks with greater th