owledge from BERT.', 'A stage in the two-stage learning framework where TinyBERT learns from BERT on a general domain dataset to improve its generalization capability.', 'The first stage of the two-stage distillation framework, providing a good initialization for task-specific distillation.', 'A key procedure in the two-stage TinyBERT learning framework, applied during pre-training.', 'The first stage of the two-stage framework in TinyBERT learning, used during pre-training to distill knowledge from BERT.', 'A stage in the TinyBERT learning framework that occurs during pre-training.', 'The first stage of the two-stage learning framework in TinyBERT, used during pre-training to transfer knowledge from the teacher BERT model to the student TinyBERT model.', 'A stage in the two-stage learning framework where TinyBERT learns knowledge from intermediate layers of the teacher BERT during pre-training.'], 'type': ['method', 'GENERIC', 'generic'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 3, 4, 6, 7, 8, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16]}, 'Task-specific Distillation (TD)': {'description': ["The second stage of TinyBERT's two-stage learning framework, performed during fine-tuning.", 'The second stage of the two-stage learning framework, performed during fine-tuning, focused on transferring task-specific knowledge from the teacher BERT to TinyBERT, often with data augmentation.', 'A stage in the two-stage learning framework where TinyBERT is fine-tuned on augmented task-specific datasets.', 'The second stage of the two-stage distillation framework, focused on learning task-specific knowledge.', 'A key procedure in the two-stage TinyBERT learning framework, applied during fine-tuning.', 'The second stage of the two-stage framework in TinyBERT learning, used during fine-tuning to adapt the model to specific tasks.', 'A stage in the TinyBERT learning framework that occurs during fine-tuning.', "A stage in TinyBERT's training framework, applied during fine-tuning on specific tasks.", "The second stage of 